<CHANGES>
<![CDATA[
###{{VERSION}}###

- Self-contained plugin: the web UI files are embedded in the .plg (no more cloudflared-utils package, so no package checksum to maintain and no build/CI checksum mismatch).
- The cloudflared binary is no longer pinned in the .plg: scripts/cf-update.sh downloads the release from Cloudflare and checks its SHA256 against both the release notes and the digest computed by GitHub. Update with `cf-update.sh stage` then `cf-update.sh apply <version>`.
- Versioning change: the plugin version is now the plugin's own (date based), no longer the cloudflared version. Existing installs must be reinstalled once (Plugins > Install Plugin, or `plugin install <url> forced`); settings in /boot/config/plugins/cloudflared/config are kept.

